8.  Calculate the sum of each geometric series using the formula `1 / (1 - r)`.
9.  Combine the resulting rational numbers to find `E[X]` as a single fraction `m/n`.
10. Ensure `m` and `n` are relatively prime.
11. Calculate `100m+n`.
